WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
That year the river came all the way up to the temple steps.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Every morning, Amma still drew the kolam at our doorstep.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
For nine days, the whole street cooked together in one big pot.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That is when your Thatha first came to our house.
